checkuser-temporary-account-bucketcount-:
{{optional}}
{{identical|$1+}}

Count to show the number of temporary accounts found on the same IPs as the user, where the number is represented as belonging within a range of counts or at the min/max bound.

Parameters:
* $1 - an integer representing the maximum bound count

checkuser-contributions-temporary-accoun:
Count range to show the number of temporary accounts found on the same IPs as the user, where the number is represented as belonging within a range of counts or at the min/max bound.

See also: {{msg-mw|checkuser-userinfocard-temporary-account-bucketcount}}

Parameters:
* $1 - one of those messages:
** {{mw-msg|checkuser-temporary-account-bucketcount-min}}
** {{mw-msg|checkuser-temporary-account-bucketcount-range}}
** {{mw-msg|checkuser-temporary-account-bucketcount-max}}
